; Regression (2026-11-05): two records of one name and one layout in two
; modules of one program, each with a method `read` of one parameter list. A
; record's type is its bare name within a package, so both methods mangle to
; `_ZN5Gauge4readEv`; the layout check (xfail_record_layout_collision) is
; silent because the fields agree, both bodies are emitted `linkonce_odr`, one
; is kept and probe_b answered what probe_a's Gauge computes, at rc 0.
; Planner.check_symbol_collisions# judges the SYMBOL: two places, one name.
; xfail: error: function read mangles to the symbol _ZN5Gauge4readEv

module symbol_collide_a
module symbol_collide_b

if probe_a() = 11 and probe_b() = 12
    print("PASS")
else
    print("FAIL")
